stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING
    PENDING --> IN_PROGRESS: user starts work
    PENDING --> COMPLETED: user completes task
    PENDING --> BLOCKED: user marks blocked
    IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED: user completes task
    IN_PROGRESS --> BLOCKED: blocker found
    BLOCKED --> IN_PROGRESS: blocker resolved
    BLOCKED --> COMPLETED: completed after unblock
    PENDING --> ARCHIVED: delete or remove
    IN_PROGRESS --> ARCHIVED: archive
    BLOCKED --> ARCHIVED: archive
    COMPLETED --> ARCHIVED: archive old task
    COMPLETED --> IN_PROGRESS: reopen
    ARCHIVED --> [*]

